  "chain": "inaccurate procedure step [cause TBD] -> Start-up Bus Differential Relay Control Switches misaligned -> CT-1/CT-2 lockout on RCP start -> loss of AC power to Unit 2 MFBs -> automatic Keowee Hydroelectric Station actuation & momentary DHR pump trip -> DHR automatically restored [backups Keowee, CT-5 Standby Buses, MFB Monitor Panel]",
